        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: The Joy Formidable, Sixpence None the Richer\n- Places: North Wales, London, England, New Braunfels, Texas, Nashville, Tennessee\n- Genres: Alternative rock, alternative Christian rock\n\nFacts:\n- The Joy Formidable is a Welsh alternative rock band that formed in 2007 in North Wales.\n- The Joy Formidable is currently based in London, England.\n- Sixpence None the Richer, also known as Sixpence, is an American alternative Christian rock band.\n- Sixpence None the Richer formed in New Braunfels, Texas.\n- Sixpence None the Richer eventually settled in Nashville, Tennessee.",
